  "instance_name": "audience_id",
  "label": "audience description",
  "description": "The target audience consists of individuals familiar with U.S. political processes, particularly congressional hearings, and those who follow or are aware of Robert Mueller's role and the Mueller Report. The meme relies on cultural knowledge of formal bureaucratic procedures and satirical commentary on institutional competence, making it most resonant with viewers who understand the context of high-stakes political hearings and the public perception of bureaucratic inefficiency. The humor is directed at perceived incompetence or absurdity in formal institutions, appealing to an audience that is critical of or cynical toward governmental processes.",
